###
# @name api List users (from Keycloak via declarative HTTP Interface)
GET http://{{host}}:8080/api/users
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

###
# @name api Create user (in Keycloak via declarative HTTP Interface)
POST http://{{host}}:8080/api/users
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "carloslopez",
  "email": "carlos.lopez@gmail.com",
  "firstName": "Carlos",
  "lastName": "Lopez",
  "password": "Password123!",
  "group": "/videoclub-default/cliente"
}


